# 🎨 BrandPost AI Image Generation Inference & Data Flow Document (.imd)

This document outlines the exact data schema, transformations, and payloads exchanged during the image generation lifecycle in **BrandPost**. It describes how the AI Agent receives input from the client frontend, expands it using a text LLM, and formats it for final image model inferencing.

---

## 🔄 End-to-End Architecture Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Client Frontend: composer/page.tsx] -->|POST Request with Raw Form Data| B[API Route: api/generate/images/route.ts]
    B -->|Fetch Brand Kit & User Session| C[Supabase Database]
    B -->|Generate Structural System Prompt| D[getImageExpansionPrompt Function]
    D -->|Request Enhanced Prompt| E[Gemini 2.5 Flash LLM]
    E -->|JSON Output: expandedPrompts| B
    B -->|Match Active Model Config| F[IMAGE_MODEL_REGISTRY]
    F -->|Inference Call| G[Google GenAI SDK]
    G -->|Imagen or Gemini Image Modality| H[Base64 Image Buffer]
    H -->|Upload & Store| I[Supabase Storage & Posts Table]
    I -->|JSON Response with Public URL| A
```

---

## 📥 1. Client Frontend Payload (How the API Receives It)

The frontend page `src/app/dashboard/composer/page.tsx` collects user selections and compiles them into a POST request.

### **API Endpoint**
`POST /api/generate/images`

### **Raw Request Body Schema**
```typescript
interface ImageGenerationRequest {
  topic: string;             // The core theme or occasion (up to 150 chars)
  contentType: string;       // Category: 'festive' | 'offer' | 'informational' | 'general'
  platform: string;          // Target: 'facebook' | 'instagram' | 'both'
  extraInstructions: string; // The "Post Description" with high-weight details or text offers
  workspaceId: string;       // Current Workspace UUID
  brandKitId?: string | null;// Explicit null if "No Brand Kit" is chosen, else undefined
  brandDetails: null | {     // Combined brand settings to guide the visual identity
    businessName: string;
    brandDescription: string;
    colors: {
      primary: string;       // Hex value
      secondary: string;     // Hex value
      accent: string;        // Hex value
    };
    brandTone: string;
    fullName?: string;
    address?: string;
    pincode?: string;
    timing?: string;
    logo?: string;           // URL of uploaded brand logo if present
  };
}
```

### **Example Frontend Payload**
```json
{
  "topic": "Diwali Special Offer",
  "contentType": "offer",
  "platform": "both",
  "extraInstructions": "Get 30% off all apparel this weekend only. Use code DIWALI30 at checkout.",
  "workspaceId": "d3b07384-d113-4c4e-9c8e-bf8d68967b5f",
  "brandDetails": {
    "businessName": "TrendSphere Apparel",
    "brandDescription": "Modern minimal clothing boutique.",
    "colors": {
      "primary": "#1A1A1A",
      "secondary": "#E5A93C",
      "accent": "#F5F5F7"
    },
    "brandTone": "elegant, luxury, minimalist",
    "fullName": "TrendSphere Apparel Inc.",
    "address": "123 Fashion Street, Mumbai",
    "pincode": "400001",
    "timing": "10 AM - 9 PM",
    "logo": "https://supabase.co/.../logos/trendsphere_logo.png"
  }
}
```

